cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InSilicoTrial MAS in research or in a trial-design decision, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "InSilicoTrial MAS: a distributed multi-agent platform for in-silico clinical trial simulation"
abstract: >-
  InSilicoTrial MAS simulates a randomised clinical trial end to end over a fully synthetic
  patient cohort: a Protocol Agent screens and randomises digital twin agents, each patient
  agent reacts epoch by epoch through mechanistic PK/PD, a learned physiology residual model
  and an optional LLM narrator, and a Biostatistician Agent produces safety and efficacy
  readouts with confidence intervals and Data Safety Monitoring Board stopping rules. It runs
  unchanged on a laptop or on Databricks/AWS with Delta Lake, Unity Catalog and MLflow, and
  is intended as a decision-support tool for trial design (dose selection, sample size and
  endpoint trade-offs), not as a source of clinical evidence or medical advice.
authors:
